---Sends an event to a specific room which directs clients to delete a specific message; that is, unrender it from view and delete it from the client’s chat history. This event’s EventName is aws:DELETE_MESSAGE. This replicates the DeleteMessage WebSocket operation in the Amazon IVS Chat Messaging API.
---
---`POST /DeleteMessage`
---Errors: AccessDeniedException, PendingVerification, ResourceNotFoundException, ThrottlingException, ValidationException.
---@param input aws.ivschat.DeleteMessageRequest
---@return aws.ivschat.DeleteMessageResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
